`Platform.OS === 'web'` is a platform-specific check inside a component that produces a hardcoded value for web only. Other files in this same PR (`MenuItemList.tsx`, `AppDownloadLinks.tsx`, `InitialSettingsPage.tsx`) use `getPlatform(true) === CONST.PLATFORM.WEB` instead, which is the project's preferred abstraction.

Use `getPlatform` for consistency with the rest of the codebase:
```tsx
import getPlatform from '@libs/getPlatform';
// ...
const isDesktopWeb = getPlatform(true) === CONST.PLATFORM.WEB;
const contextMenuAccessibilityLabel = isDesktopWeb && !!onSecondaryInteraction ? translate('accessibilityHints.contextMenuAvailable') : '';
```

