Platform-specific logic is embedded directly in the component using `Platform.OS` checks. This increases maintenance overhead and complexity.

**Suggested fix:**
Extract platform-specific logic into separate utility functions or use platform-specific file extensions (e.g., `openSettings.ios.ts`, `openSettings.android.ts`):

```tsx
// utils/openLocationSettings.ios.ts
